[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:A Pleasant Climate]
[00:00.62]Lesson 51 | 第51课
[00:02.99]A pleasant climate | 宜人的气候
[00:05.58]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答这个问题。
[00:11.31]Does it ever snow in Greece? | 希腊下雪吗？
[00:16.10]Where do you come from? | 你来自哪里？
[00:19.83]I come from Greece. | 我来自希腊。
[00:22.90]What's the climate like in your country? | 你们国家的气候怎么样？
[00:26.90]It's very pleasant. | 非常宜人。
[00:29.96]What's the weather like in spring? | 春天的天气怎么样？
[00:33.08]It's often windy in March. | 三月经常刮风。
[00:37.74]It's always warm in April and May, but it rains sometimes. | 四月和五月总是很暖和，但有时会下雨。
[00:44.76]What's it like in summer? | 夏天怎么样？
[00:48.36]It's always hot in June, July and August. | 六月、七月和八月总是很热。
[00:54.25]The sun shines every day. | 每天阳光普照。
[00:58.06]Is it cold or warm in autumn? | 秋天是冷还是暖和？
[01:01.92]It's always warm in September and October. | 九月和十月总是很暖和。
[01:07.04]It's often cold in November and it rains sometimes. | 十一月经常很冷，有时会下雨。
[01:13.02]Is it very cold in winter? | 冬天很冷吗？
[01:17.07]It's often cold in December, January and February. | 十二月、一月和二月经常很冷。
[01:23.14]It snows sometimes. | 有时会下雪。